# ============================================================================
# ZidMirvela — Arabic catalogue
#
# English needs no catalogue: the msgid IS the English source.
#
# RULES
#   - msgid must match the template byte-for-byte, punctuation included.
#     "Save" and "Save." are DIFFERENT strings.
#   - Never edit a msgid here without editing the template in the same commit,
#     and vice versa — a drift silently reverts that string to English.
#   - %(name)s placeholders may MOVE within a sentence but must not change.
#
# Tone: Mirvela is a beauty retailer with a mostly female audience, so the
# customer-facing calls to action use the feminine imperative (ابحثي / اكتشفي /
# ابدئي). Switch to neutral phrasing if the brand voice changes.
# ============================================================================


